# Build context for the Section-5 Containerfile (migration-runbook.md).
# .git/ first: the object store holds the confidential branch commits,
# no workspace crate has a build.rs or git-metadata consumer (the image
# tag carries the SHA instead), and excluding it keeps the daemon
# context tarball lean.
.git/
target/
data/
.env*
tamako.toml
*.log
.omp/
*decision*.md
review-*.md
eval-*.md
rust-toolchain.toml
# ^ decision 120: the dev-lane toolchain pin stays OUT of the image
#   context — the FROM base pin alone governs the in-image compiler;
#   carrying the toml would make rustup shims auto-fetch the pinned
#   channel + fmt/clippy components mid-build (planner AND builder).
# Exception: the decision-109 pin (LBUG_VERSION = "0.19.1") lives in
# .cargo/config.toml; dropping it unpins the C++ core (the download
# script falls back to `main`).
!.cargo/config.toml
